{"id": 14391, "title": "What to do tomorrow?", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK1"], "slug": "what-to-do-tomorrow", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/14391_what-to-do-tomorrow.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["A：明天你想做什么？", "B：明天去学校。", "A：明天星期六，休息。", "B：是呢，我忘了。明天上午我想在家睡觉，下午我想去书店买书，你呢？", "A：我想去买东西。", "B：你想买什么？", "A：我想买一个杯子，一盒牛奶，还有一些水果。", "B：你喜欢吃什么水果？", "A：我喜欢吃香蕉和苹果。", "B：我家也没有水果了。现在的苹果很好，你帮我也买一斤吧。", "A：没问题。我明天几点给你苹果？", "B：明天我五点从书店回家，你五点来我家吧。你也可以在我家吃饭，明天我们自己做，怎么样？", "A：好，明天五点我去你家。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["A：明天你想做什麼？", "B：明天去學校。", "A：明天星期六，休息。", "B：是呢，我忘了。明天上午我想在家睡覺，下午我想去書店買書，你呢？", "A：我想去買東西。", "B：你想買什麼？", "A：我想買一個杯子，一盒牛奶，還有一些水果。", "B：你喜歡吃什麼水果？", "A：我喜歡吃香蕉和蘋果。", "B：我家也沒有水果了。現在的蘋果很好，你幫我也買一斤吧。", "A：沒問題。我明天幾點給你蘋果？", "B：明天我五點從書店回家，你五點來我家吧。你也可以在我家吃飯，明天我們自己做，怎麼樣？", "A：好，明天五點我去你家。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["A： míng tiān nǐ xiǎng zuò shén me？", "B： míng tiān qù xué xiào。", "A： míng tiān Xīng qī liù， xiū xi。", "B： shì ne， wǒ wàng le。 míng tiān shàng wǔ wǒ xiǎng zài jiā shuì jiào， xià wǔ wǒ xiǎng qù shū diàn mǎi shū， nǐ ne？", "A： wǒ xiǎng qù mǎi dōng xi。", "B： nǐ xiǎng mǎi shén me？", "A： wǒ xiǎng mǎi yī gè bēi zi， yī hé niú nǎi， hái yǒu yī xiē shuǐ guǒ。", "B： nǐ xǐ huan chī shén me shuǐ guǒ？", "A： wǒ xǐ huan chī xiāng jiāo hé píng guǒ。", "B： wǒ jiā yě méi yǒu shuǐ guǒ le。 xiàn zài de píng guǒ hěn hǎo， nǐ bāng wǒ yě mǎi yī jīn ba。", "A： méi wèn tí。 wǒ míng tiān jǐ diǎn gěi nǐ píng guǒ？", "B： míng tiān wǒ wǔ diǎn cóng shū diàn huí jiā， nǐ wǔ diǎn lái wǒ jiā ba。 nǐ yě kě yǐ zài wǒ jiā chī fàn， míng tiān wǒ men zì jǐ zuò， zěn me yàng？", "A： hǎo， míng tiān wǔ diǎn wǒ qù nǐ jiā。"], "english_paragraphs": ["A: What do you want to do tomorrow?", "B: Go to school tomorrow.", "A: Tomorrow is Saturday, off.", "B: Yes, I forgot. I want to sleep at home tomorrow morning, and I want to go to the bookstore to buy books in the afternoon. What about you?", "A: I want to go shopping.", "B: What do you want to buy?", "A: I want to buy a cup, a carton of milk, and some fruit.", "B: What fruit do you like to eat?", "A: I like to eat bananas and apples.", "B: There is no more fruit at my house. The apples are very good now. Please help me buy a pound.", "A: No problem. What time should I give you the apple tomorrow?", "B: I will go home from the bookstore at five o'clock tomorrow. You can come to my house at five o'clock. You can also have dinner at my house and we can cook it ourselves tomorrow, how about that?", "A: OK, I will go to your house at five o'clock tomorrow."], "english_full": "A: What do you want to do tomorrow?\n\nB: Go to school tomorrow.\n\nA: Tomorrow is Saturday, off.\n\nB: Yes, I forgot. I want to sleep at home tomorrow morning, and I want to go to the bookstore to buy books in the afternoon. What about you?\n\nA: I want to go shopping.\n\nB: What do you want to buy?\n\nA: I want to buy a cup, a carton of milk, and some fruit.\n\nB: What fruit do you like to eat?\n\nA: I like to eat bananas and apples.\n\nB: There is no more fruit at my house. The apples are very good now. Please help me buy a pound.\n\nA: No problem. What time should I give you the apple tomorrow?\n\nB: I will go home from the bookstore at five o'clock tomorrow. You can come to my house at five o'clock. You can also have dinner at my house and we can cook it ourselves tomorrow, how about that?\n\nA: OK, I will go to your house at five o'clock tomorrow.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">A</span><span class=\"tr\">A</span><rt></rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"míng tiān\" data-defn=\"tomorrow\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">明天</span><span class=\"tr\">明天</span><rt>míng tiān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǐ\" data-defn=\"you\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiǎng\" data-defn=\"to desire; to want (to)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zuò\" data-defn=\"to do; to engage in; to hold (a party etc)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">做</span><span class=\"tr\">做</span><rt>zuò</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shén me\" data-defn=\"what?\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">什么</span><span class=\"tr\">什麼</span><rt>shén me</rt></ruby>？", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">B</span><span class=\"tr\">B</span><rt></rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"míng tiān\" data-defn=\"tomorrow\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">明天</span><span class=\"tr\">明天</span><rt>míng tiān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"qù\" data-defn=\"to go, to go to\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xué xiào\" data-defn=\"school\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">学校</span><span class=\"tr\">學校</span><rt>xué xiào</rt></ruby>。", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">A</span><span class=\"tr\">A</span><rt></rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"míng tiān\" data-defn=\"tomorrow\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">明天</span><span class=\"tr\">明天</span><rt>míng tiān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Xīng qī liù\" data-defn=\"Saturday\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">星期六</span><span class=\"tr\">星期六</span><rt>Xīng qī liù</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiū xi\" data-defn=\"to rest\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">休息</span><span class=\"tr\">休息</span><rt>xiū xi</rt></ruby>。", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">B</span><span class=\"tr\">B</span><rt></rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì\" data-defn=\"indeed (used for emphasis)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ne\" data-defn=\"(discourse particle) used to mark a slight pause or emphasis in speech\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">呢</span><span class=\"tr\">呢</span><rt>ne</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wàng\" data-defn=\"to forget / to overlook / to neglect\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">忘</span><span class=\"tr\">忘</span><rt>wàng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"le\" data-defn=\"(completed action marker) / (modal particle indicating change of state, situation now)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"míng tiān\" data-defn=\"tomorrow\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">明天</span><span class=\"tr\">明天</span><rt>míng tiān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shàng wǔ\" data-defn=\"morning\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">上午</span><span class=\"tr\">上午</span><rt>shàng wǔ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiǎng\" data-defn=\"to desire; to want (to)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zài\" data-defn=\"(of sb or sth) to be (located) at\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiā\" data-defn=\"home / family / (polite) my (sister, uncle etc)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shuì jiào\" data-defn=\"to go to bed / to sleep\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">睡觉</sp